+// ---- gin-restore (rs): the restore request, strict window MRs, the setup agreement (EXPERIMENT.md 9.10.8) ----
+// A process asks for the restore when NCCL_GIN_FAULT_POLICY=hold and NCCL_GIN_RESTORE != 0 (default 1), or when it is a
+// spare process (NCCL_GIN_RESTORE_SPARE=<logical rank>). Such a process registers every GDAKI window MR with strict
+// ordering, whatever the application's window flags (ncclGinGdakiRegMrSym; user decision 2026-10-11). The registration
+// gets no error path of its own (one rank failing there would leave the others in the rkey all-gather). Instead every rank
