+// The checkpoint's state (EXPERIMENT.md 9.4): first the text of impl/rs_ckpt_api.h between its "shared text" fences,
+// verbatim, then the decisions and the bookkeeping as pure functions (unit-tested on the CPU), then the per-context
+// checkpoint state. The moves are in the region "checkpoint machine".
